The paused designer for this card is on branch `claude/project-thread-d8t1hm` (head `1f9f234303`), from draft PR #36784, now closed unmerged. Take from it:

- `ui/packages/app-shell/src/views/studio-design/publicForm/publicFormDesign.ts` and `PublicFormsDesigner.tsx`, with `publicFormDesign.test.ts` (25 cases) and `PublicFormsDesigner.test.tsx` (14 cases). Both contract-review rounds' fixes live in these files:
  - a new form's name is refused when any other view item has it;
  - writing back keeps every key and every text the person did not edit, including an unnamed section and translation maps;
  - save and publish carry the on/off switch as stored at that time;
  - publish writes back the stored draft and refuses when it cannot be read.
- The `engine.studio.publicForms.*` keys in `ui/packages/i18n/src/namespaces/studio/{en,zh}.ts`.
- Two fixes not yet on `main`:
  - Setup's Unknown row offers no switch (`PublicFormsSetupPage.tsx` and its test);
  - the `anonymousFormIntakeWithdrawnIn` docblock in `packages/spec/src/ui/anonymous-form-intake.ts`.

Leave behind:
- the Form-tab switch in `StudioDesignSurface.tsx` (item 3 of this card);
- the designer's own form list, which Studio's `form` list replaces (item 4);
- the `access-security.json` anchor edits (already on `main` via #37017).

